{"unit_id":"lim12137__dsh-llm-extra-retry#card-zh","repo":"lim12137/dsh-llm-extra-retry","commit":"37c85c373eb2e6186a7354ff6b2a88107d6872fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-extra-retry 是一个为 DeepSeek Harness 模型请求增加恢复能力的后台插件。它监听 agent/request-error 瀑布，仅处理提供方归类为 PI_AI_ERROR 的失败；遇到该错误时等待固定 20 秒，再以相同提供方和模型请求重试一次，并为这项策略独立记录重试状态。若错误属于其他类别，或同一步骤已经重试过一次，就交由后续处理器继续处理。等待期间请求被取消或插件卸载时，等待会结束。适合希望对无法识别的上游模型错误自动恢复的 DSH 使用者；源码没有要求额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-24","lib/index.js:71-120"]}
{"unit_id":"lim12137__dsh-llm-extra-retry#card-en","repo":"lim12137/dsh-llm-extra-retry","commit":"37c85c373eb2e6186a7354ff6b2a88107d6872fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-llm-extra-retry adds recovery to DeepSeek Harness model requests. It handles PI_AI_ERROR on the agent/request-error waterfall, waits 20 seconds, then retries once with separate tracking. Other errors pass onward. Aborted requests or plugin disposal cancel pending waits.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-24","lib/index.js:71-120"]}
