{"unit_id":"lim12137__dsh-llm-extra-retry#feature-1","repo":"lim12137/dsh-llm-extra-retry","commit":"37c85c373eb2e6186a7354ff6b2a88107d6872fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-extra-retry 的「PI_AI_ERROR 重试」功能：模型请求遇到 PI_AI_ERROR 时，等待 20 秒后自动重试同一步骤一次；再次失败则交给后续处理器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-34","lib/index.js:71-105"]}
{"unit_id":"lim12137__dsh-llm-extra-retry#feature-2","repo":"lim12137/dsh-llm-extra-retry","commit":"37c85c373eb2e6186a7354ff6b2a88107d6872fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-extra-retry 的「请求取消等待」功能：等待重试期间若请求信号中止，定时器和监听器会被清理，恢复流程不再启动重试。取消由请求的 abort 信号自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:47-69","lib/index.js:101-105"]}
{"unit_id":"lim12137__dsh-llm-extra-retry#feature-3","repo":"lim12137/dsh-llm-extra-retry","commit":"37c85c373eb2e6186a7354ff6b2a88107d6872fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-extra-retry 的「卸载时清理」功能：插件卸载时取消所有待处理的延迟，并等待活动中的恢复流程结束。清理由插件 effect 的卸载回调自动执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113-120"]}
{"unit_id":"lim12137__dsh-llm-extra-retry#caveat-1","repo":"lim12137/dsh-llm-extra-retry","commit":"37c85c373eb2e6186a7354ff6b2a88107d6872fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-extra-retry 使用前须知：只处理 PI_AI_ERROR，并固定等待 20 秒后重试一次；其他错误类别会交给后续处理器。（见 lib/index.js:31-34、71-81）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-34","lib/index.js:71-81"]}
